      "writtenOn": "2025-06-03T20:41:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Like here, might as well just write out the `SkPoint` or go with `auto\u0026\u0026` which will deduce to `const SkPoint\u0026` anyway.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 648,
        "startChar": 25,
